OL,3,GNEWSADog rescued after getting head
OL,4,Astuck in breeze-block
OL,5,
OL,6,FA dog got itself in a bit of a squeeze
OL,7,Fafter chasing a fox, with the pursuit
OL,8,Fending in a call to the fire service.
OL,10,FCookie the cavapoo, from Gosport, got
OL,11,Fhis head stuck in a decorative garden
OL,12,Fbreeze-block during the chase.
OL,14,FHampshire Fire and Rescue Service said
OL,15,Fon-call firefighters from Fareham
OL,16,Fattended the scene earlier this month
OL,17,Fand found the pooch in distress.
OL,19,FThe fire service said crews chipped
OL,20,Faway at the block and made several
OL,21,Fcareful cuts, allowing it to crumble
OL,22,Faway and freeing Cookie safely.
OL,23,APub: 26-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
